 {
  "n": 7,
  "hidden": false,
  "text": [
   "Labeling Criteria",
   "02",
   "Labeling target",
   "1. Bounding Box: Face= The person’s head, face, and neck must be contained within the bounding box area.\nHair, hats, headbands, bag, etc are not include in the bounding box area. \nPlease note that neck, face until forehead is labeling area to b-box."
  ],
  "notes": "",
  "img": "assets/day3/photobooth/s07.jpg"
 },
 {
  "n": 8,
  "hidden": false,
  "text": [
   "Labeling Criteria",
   "02",
   "Labeling target",
   "2. Attributes: Gender, Age, and Image brightness= Please select the correct age, gender, and image brightness seen in the image."
  ],
  "notes": "",
  "img": "assets/day3/photobooth/s08.jpg"
 },
 {
  "n": 9,
  "hidden": false,
  "text": [
   "Labeling Criteria",
   "02",
   "Labeling target",
   "3. Polygon: Body= The person’s whole-body outline must be labeled with the polygon tool.\nHair, bags, hat, headbands, etc are labeling target for the body class."
  ],
  "notes": "",
  "img": "assets/day3/photobooth/s09.jpg"
 },
